<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-QNI half year profit falls sharply.</title>
<headline>RTRS-QNI half year profit falls sharply.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    14.38 vs 71.67</p>
<p>    Net				     13.32 vs 52.45</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     2.0  vs 5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: QNI Ltd is a nickel and cobalt miner.  </p>
